%% Main system flow - Gemini Music Recommender
%% Preview: https://mermaid.live or a Mermaid extension in VS Code.
%% Must match the code. If a module changes, update this file.
%% Testing is shown inside boxes A and 4, not as a separate block.
flowchart TD
    A(["User chats<br/>(a real person, or a fake persona<br/>when run_eval.py tests the system)"]):::human
    B["1. Input check<br/>guardrails.py"]
    C["2. Interview agent<br/>interview.py<br/>asks, extracts, repeats until confident"]
    D[("Docs for RAG<br/>docs/*.md")]
    E{{"Gemini<br/>llm.py"}}
    F["3. User profile<br/>values + confidence"]
    G[("Song catalog<br/>songs.csv")]
    H["4. Recommender<br/>recommender.py<br/>scores songs, picks top 5<br/>(persona test: run_eval.py checks the top 5<br/>and prints PASS or FAIL)"]
    I["5. Explain each song<br/>Gemini + docs, then fact check"]
    J([User rates each song 1-10]):::human
    K["6. Feedback<br/>feedback.py<br/>metrics + profile update"]

    A --> B --> C
    D -->|retrieved text| C
    C <-->|questions and answers| E
    C --> F
    F --> H
    G --> H
    H --> I
    D -->|retrieved text| I
    I <--> E
    I --> J
    J --> K
    K -->|"Regenerate (after all 5 rated)"| F

    classDef human fill:#ffe9a8,stroke:#b58900,color:#000
